    "_elevation_note": "Elevation (box-shadow), motion-easing (cubic-bezier), the Geist/Geist Mono webfonts, and the full DARK theme are realised in apps/dashboard/app/globals.css (the runtime token source) — the DTCG dialect this engine validates supports only color/dimension/number/fontFamily/fontWeight/duration, so shadow/cubicBezier KINDS and the per-theme (.dark) value pairs live in globals.css + DESIGN.md, not here. tokens.json encodes the LIGHT canonical set. See DESIGN.md §Foundation.",
